# CLI clang-tidy policy: inherits the root config and adds the CLI and public headers to the header
# filter. No checks are disabled here. Where a POSIX call or a signal handler makes a check
# unavoidable, the site carries a NOLINTNEXTLINE(check) with the reason.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*/(src/(core|shell|cli)|include/pwcap)/.*'
...
